### Terminal Fast Lookups (`kubectl`)

```bash
# Triage OOMKilled containers
kubectl describe pod <pod-name> | grep -E "Exit Code|Reason|Last State"

# Launch ephemeral debug container
kubectl debug pod/<pod-name> -it --image=busybox:1.36 --target=<container-name>

# Inspect node pressure conditions
kubectl describe node <node-name> | grep -A 6 Conditions
```

### Exam Context & Permissibility Notes

- Headless LitmusChaos is a homelab failure injection simulator `[HOMELAB AUXILIARY]`. The exam environment will never have Litmus installed or permitted in the browser; all troubleshooting drills must be diagnosed and resolved using standard Kubernetes primitives and inspection commands.

